# Local agent state. Rulesync-generated projections (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md,
# .claude/skills/, .agents/skills/, ...) are committed, not ignored.
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/AGENTS.local.md
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/*.lock
**/.claude/memories/
**/.agents/memories/
rulesync.local.jsonc
.rulesync.local/
.rulesync/rules/*.local.md

# Podklady na analýzu (FIT, exporty, screenshoty) - citlivé dáta, mimo Gitu
beh/

# Miestny prepis konfigurácie viazaný na počítač
bimbo-trener.local.json

# Dáta trénera nikdy nepatria do Gitu (žijú v dátovom adresári)
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3.gz
*.fit
*.FIT
journal-export*.jsonl
